    the global marker-to-path assignment via sightlines must be unique
  spacing: all objects (paths + markers) are non-adjacent (min Manhattan distance >= 4) [observed]
  density: non-bg cells ~3-7% of grid [observed]
  all_colors_distinct: every path and marker color is unique across the grid

generation_strategy:
