52:     - Keep every multi-pixel outline object.
53:     - Remove all isolated marker pixels from the canvas.
54:     - For each enclosed interior region, fill all of its cells with the unique most frequent marker color found inside it.
55: 
56:     Key insight
57:     - The target to fill is the set of cells unreachable from the outline bbox boundary without crossing that outline.
58:     """
59:     g = np.asarray(grid, dtype=int)
